    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy just feels like another thing on the list of things that wont work. it just feels like i'm wasting everyone's time, even the doctors. even if i \"get the tools,\" i'll just go back to the same place eventually. it feels so pointless. like, what is the point of fighting so hard just to be back at zero every few months?",
